X('bap-103','A candidate wants to prepare a testimony. Which three parts does the lesson give?','Your life before Christ, how you met Him, and what has changed since','Your childhood, your conversion, and your calling','Your struggle, your prayer, and your answer','Your past, your decision, and your plans'),
X('bap-103','A candidate’s testimony is ten minutes long and focuses on his own successes. What does the lesson say?','Keep it short, honest, and focused on Jesus, not on yourself','Keep it detailed, so that people understand how God worked','Keep it encouraging, so that listeners are inspired','Keep it balanced, with a mix of struggle and victory'),
X('bap-103','How does the lesson describe baptism on the day itself?','By immersion, in the name of the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit','By pouring, as a sign of the Spirit coming on a believer','By immersion, in the name of Jesus Christ','By sprinkling, as a sign of cleansing'),
X('bap-103','A candidate asks what to do before baptism day. What does the lesson suggest?','Plan what to wear, what to bring, and whom to invite, and ask your pastor for guidelines','Fast and pray for several days so that the heart is ready','Meet with the pastor to review your testimony and answers','Confess any sin so that the conscience is clear'),
X('bap-103','Colossians 3:1-10 says to put off the old self and put on the new. What does the lesson say to put on?','Compassion, kindness, humility, and love','Wisdom, courage, patience, and faith','Holiness, righteousness, truth, and peace','Joy, thanksgiving, prayer, and praise'),
X('bap-103','A newly baptized believer thinks the work is done. What does the lesson say?','Baptism is a beginning, and the new life it pictures must be lived out day by day','Baptism completes the first step, and growth follows with time and teaching','Baptism marks a change, and others will see it in the believer’s life','Baptism seals the believer’s commitment, so it will be sustained by grace'),
X('bap-103','According to Romans 6:4, what is the purpose of being buried with Christ in baptism?','That we too may live a new life','That we may be free from sin and death','That we may share in His resurrection','That we may be united with Him in His death'),
X('bap-103','Which practice does the lesson say helps a newly baptized believer grow?','Stay close to the church family, since growth happens in community','Spend time in daily prayer and Scripture so that faith is deepened','Serve in a ministry so that gifts are discovered','Share the testimony with others so that faith is strengthened'),
X('bap-103','Psalm 66:16 says, “Come and hear, all you who fear God, and I will tell you what he has done for me.” What does this describe?','A testimony, a simple story of what God has done in your life','A prayer, a response of gratitude for God’s help','A praise, a declaration of God’s greatness','A teaching, a lesson that is passed on to others'),
X('bap-103','What does Mark 5:18-20 show about a testimony?','The healed man told others what the Lord had done for him, and people were amazed','The healed man followed Jesus and learned from Him','The healed man waited until he was asked to share his story','The healed man spoke to the crowd and invited them to believe'),
X('bap-103','Which statement matches the lesson on old habits after baptism?','Put off sins and habits that belong to the old life','Be patient with old habits, since they fade with time','Avoid the places that are linked to old habits','Ask for prayer so that old habits are broken')
