Object.assign(BIBLE,{"Deuteronomy 22:8":"When thou buildest a new house, then thou shalt make a battlement for thy roof, that thou bring not blood upon thine house, if any man fall from thence.","Mark 12:31":"And the second is like, namely this, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself. There is none other commandment greater than these.","Proverbs 14:26":"In the fear of the LORD is strong confidence: and his children shall have a place of refuge.","1 Thessalonians 5:14":"Now we exhort you, brethren, warn them that are unruly, comfort the feebleminded, support the weak, be patient toward all men."});
Object.assign(BIBLE,{"1 John 3:1":"Behold, what manner of love the Father hath bestowed upon us, that we should be called the sons of God: therefore the world knoweth us not, because it knew him not.","1 John 4:19":"We love him, because he first loved us.","Galatians 5:22-23":"But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, gentleness, goodness, faith, Meekness, temperance: against such there is no law.","Ephesians 5:1-2":"Be ye therefore followers of God, as dear children; And walk in love, as Christ also hath loved us, and hath given himself for us an offering and a sacrifice to God for a sweet smelling savour.","John 15:14-15":"Ye are my friends, if ye do whatsoever I command you. Henceforth I call you not servants; for the servant knoweth not what his lord doeth: but I have called you friends; for all things that I have heard of my Father I have made known unto you.","Matthew 22:37-39":"Jesus said unto him, Thou shalt love the Lord thy God with all thy heart, and with all thy soul, and with all thy mind. This is the first and great commandment. And the second is like unto it, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.","James 1:22":"But be ye doers of the word, and not hearers only, deceiving your own selves.","Psalm 96:1":"O sing unto the LORD a new song: sing unto the LORD, all the earth.","Psalm 78:4":"We will not hide them from their children, shewing to the generation to come the praises of the LORD, and his strength, and his wonderful works that he hath done."});
